willingness|The independent Vietnamese gloss names readiness, not a fragment requiring an object. Listen example supports willingness to plus infinitive without claiming actual ability or a tense rule.
commentator|Broadcast speaker is not conflated with referee or reporter. Vietnamese preserves causal explanation; the definition allows commentary beyond sport rather than imposing an overly narrow domain.
guest|Invited-person boundary and individual seat example align. The card translation retains the seat information without inventing an event type; accommodation senses are not claimed exhaustive.
melody|Musical sequence is differentiated from harmony with a flute and accompaniment context. Both instruments are retained in Vietnamese; grammar notes stay learner-facing and make no science claims.
overwhelm|Emotion, excessive demand and competitive defeat have distinct Oxford ordinals and objects. All three translations preserve intensity without shifting to ordinary surprise or merely a large quantity.
